 "about": "The Governor hires a podcast philosopher to test his livestock for courage; the cow passes, the state certifies it Silver class, and Big Don learns that a citizen cannot be dinner.",
 "beats": [
  {
   "k": "title",
   "mood": "playful and comic"
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "A Texas ranch at midday. The Governor has bought a book about Plato, and now he must find out which of his citizens have courage.",
   "see": [
    {
     "place": "p0a"
    },
    "a man in a cowboy hat leaning on a fence"
   ],
   "mood": "country western",
   "wav": "pilot/ep08/v01.wav",
