   "shots": [
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/fa46dcdd-84b9-5716-9660-3855f719e66f/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/1e56b8e7-0bc4-5f4a-995e-c2fe206bc74f.mp4",
     "in": 0.0,
     "src": "The Green Promise",
     "y": 1949,
     "q": "p0a"
    },
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/c250e596-002d-510b-b856-1c963136e4c8/v3-ffmpeg-openclip-1/clips/3715ff1e-49e3-5876-96cf-3ab9069384cc.mp4",
     "in": 0.0,
     "dur": 20.79,
     "src": "VISIT FOR LUTHER BURBANK, THE GREAT AMERICAN NATURALIST",
     "y": 1917,
     "q": "a man in a cowboy hat leaning on a fence",
     "fit": 0.332
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "k": "intro",
   "who": "BIG DON"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "BIG DON",
   "text": "Now, Bro-crates, I invited you out here because you said you could help me identify the spirited citizens.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep08/v03.wav",
   "d": 6.875,
   "e": "0qzyzzvctvzrxnp9krsvptrtvnrqjtphqf600000"
  },
  {
   "k": "intro",
   "who": "BRO-CRATES"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "BRO-CRATES",
   "text": "Oh, absolutely. Thumos. The courage gland. We're gonna Socratically interrogate this cow.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep08/v05.wav",
   "d": 5.2,
   "e": "00zuvtzrtuzwmpyyqzwkuywpvwpwswvtpls80000"
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "Asking questions of a creature that cannot answer is an old method. In ancient Athens, they say, Socrates tried it on a goat.",
   "see": [
    "an old marble statue of a bearded man",
    "a goat chewing"
   ],
   "mood": "playful and comic",
   "wav": "pilot/ep08/v06.wav",
   "d": 9.425,
   "e": "0xyxyvyxtwwyxuyzyq00yzwxzkwxyivvzwxxwe00",
   "shots": [
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/1d4ef756-c577-5d14-9a60-438f53e5b104/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/48277266-57c0-5172-be27-05c2fa6c3910.mp4",
     "in": 5.0,
     "dur": 6.54,
     "src": "Space Flight: Application of Orbital Mechanics",
     "y": 1994,
     "q": "an old marble statue of a bearded man",
     "fit": 0.32
    },
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/dd68369a-882b-575d-b148-8c89a5d497b1/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/5278240d-5318-5e86-ba30-aed8ef886757.mp4",
     "in": 8.0,
     "dur": 15.31,
     "src": "Billie, the Buffalo Baby",
     "y": 1956,
     "q": "a goat chewing",
     "fit": 0.327
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "SOCRATES",
   "text": "Tell me, goat, what is virtue?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep08/v07.wav",
   "d": 2.9,
   "e": "000gzzwxvsyxwnh00hyvxxvwzxsputomc0000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "GOAT",
   "text": "Maaaaa.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep08/v08.wav",
   "d": 1.2,
   "e": "0000000dstvxxzzzzywtqkf00000000000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "SOCRATES",
   "text": "Ah. You admit you do not know. Excellent.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep08/v09.wav",
   "d": 3.575,
   "e": "000xxwvyxvzsdyvyxsqzwtrc00xoqzwqkg000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "BRO-CRATES",
   "text": "Okay. First question. Cow... what is courage? Is courage... the willingness to face danger? Would you say you face danger... every day... by existing near a grill?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep08/v10.wav",
   "d": 7.925,
   "e": "0wyxwuuxwtzqwvdzzswuzttxusymyystvvxts000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "BIG DON",
   "text": "Bro-crates, we don't threaten the livestock with barbecue.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep08/v11.wav",
   "d": 4.075,
   "e": "000zzizueqvt4rynruwkfro9kfspgejb00000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "intro",
   "who": "COW"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "COW",
   "text": "Moo.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep08/v13.wav",
   "d": 1.25,
   "e": "0000000028vzzzwurlg899500000000000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "BRO-CRATES",
   "text": "WHOA. That's basically an admission of fearlessness.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep08/v14.wav",
   "d": 3.1,
   "e": "000vzzvxsilzypswxwuyzqwvgvzwthshh7000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "BIG DON",
   "text": "That sounded like a moo.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep08/v15.wav",
   "d": 2.35,
   "e": "00004yzy8jtzzyvwnnur4qorsrmid00000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "BRO-CRATES",
   "text": "Exactly. The moo is a refusal to elaborate. That's pure alpha energy.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep08/v16.wav",
   "d": 4.5,
   "e": "00vzusyyzzyvvrzwmxwyvuftvluywspxxl800000"
  },
  {
   "k": "chorus",
   "ask": "a cow is a cow",
   "who": "A CITIZEN",
   "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/8b2ceba5-081a-597d-8c93-6a0238f4a3d6/v3-ffmpeg-openclip-1/clips/0c837216-f55c-575f-a284-f7f037106265.mp4",
   "in": 11.17,
   "d": 5.13,
   "said": "And if the milk is up to the established high standard, the cow is then ready for the milker.",
   "src": "White Ammunition",
   "y": 1942
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "A Board of Regents machine flies in over the fence with a form. A cow that shows courage can be certified Silver class, a guardian of the state.",
   "see": [
    "a small airplane flying low over a field",
    "a man filling in a form"
   ],
   "mood": "driving rhythm",
   "wav": "pilot/ep08/v18.wav",
   "d": 10.375,
   "e": "0zyyuxxuyvvvrsxe0rzuzwv0zwwuxwn0yyvuvk00",
   "shots": [
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/8ea27ccd-4b2d-5dfd-8323-01c004a2976b/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/4b323730-7852-56da-9423-50c5b5892f84.mp4",
     "in": 0.0,
     "dur": 4.67,
     "src": "Look to Lockheed for Leadership (Part I)",
     "y": 1940,
     "q": "a small airplane flying low over a field",
     "fit": 0.298
    },
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/387d2c8b-acd9-542f-91a3-d27f62edd75f/v3-ffmpeg-openclip-1/clips/39551ac3-3e57-56f5-8fe9-c64b405241eb.mp4",
     "in": 2.0,
     "dur": 4.7,
     "src": "Fate of the forests, ca. 1980 - ca. 1985",
     "y": null,
     "q": "a man filling in a form",
     "fit": 0.342
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "BIG DON",
   "text": "Well I'll be. We can make a cow a Guardian?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep08/v19.wav",
   "d": 3.35,
   "e": "000nzzztuvriphsummanwtpcrtmjfa0000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "BRO-CRATES",
   "text": "Dude... imagine. A cow with civic virtue. A cow that protects the ranch.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep08/v20.wav",
   "d": 4.0,
   "e": "00hzzyzywxtvywnxrzxoq8pzysuxumvxugh00000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "BIG DON",
   "text": "Now hold on. If the cow becomes Silver-class, does it still get to be... eaten?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep08/v21.wav",
   "d": 5.425,
   "e": "00wyzzxqllzqrpsumspghduqgoob00npff000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "BRO-CRATES",
   "text": "That is... the real Allegory of the Cave.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep08/v22.wav",
   "d": 2.75,
   "e": "000hzzvxup6wwzzvqxxvuxvupshxwrkb00000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "BIG DON",
   "text": "'Cause I'm not gonna lie, I got plans for that cow.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep08/v23.wav",
   "d": 4.05,
   "e": "002zzxyzpvxtvuqfkou1suqekoe6nlf300000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "COW",
   "text": "MOO.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep08/v24.wav",
   "d": 1.25,
   "e": "0000000028vzzzwurlg899500000000000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "BRO-CRATES",
   "text": "See?! Defiance! That's thumos! That's courage! That cow just refused your culinary authoritarianism!",
   "wav": "pilot/ep08/v25.wav",
   "d": 5.8,
   "e": "0dzwuzvuswztwpwxi00vtvtqzsoyxvstwwsi0000"
  },
  {
   "k": "chorus",
   "ask": "you can't argue with a cow",
   "who": "A CITIZEN",
   "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/fe0a4994-fc16-5b75-a11e-b0860f4a1a69/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/0467d822-03a6-5d49-abd8-0ebd00931c86.mp4",
   "in": 20.29,
   "d": 2.16,
   "said": "We didn't want to drown the cows.",
   "src": "Belmont Historical Society Presents: Ralph Burns Remembers 11/03/2000",
   "y": 2000
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "The verdict comes back. The cow displays courage. It is Silver class now, and in this Republic the Silver class cannot be owned.",
   "see": [
    "a rubber stamp on a document",
    "a cow standing in a field"
   ],
   "mood": "ritual and ceremony",
   "wav": "pilot/ep08/v27.wav",
   "d": 9.05,
   "e": "0zzoyvf0tzwwvxqf1zwvxwv0zyuvtsyutwuwrd00",
   "shots": [
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/39ad9220-677a-577e-be9b-bd628a9c12af/v5-windowed-clip-split-1/clips/bbd41e0a-92ef-58eb-b165-8ea7434b23af.mp4",
